fs.writeFileSync(path.join(root,'docs/nacent-integration.md'),'Nacent embeds this pinned SliceLab build for resin quotations. GPU slice volume includes prepared model and supports; time uses configurable exposure, lift/retract speeds and rest. Only numeric results and parameters are stored in the quote cloud. No printer-ready export is promised.\nThe ruler icon is always visible, including Basic mode. Point to point measures Euclidean surface distance. Point to baseplate projects the clicked surface point perpendicularly to the y=0 build plane (printer Z height). Width X, length Y, height Z dimensions use precise transformed mesh vertices and update on selection, scaling and rotation. Selected model(s) take precedence; with no selection the active plate models are measured. Hold Alt to navigate while measuring, Escape to exit.\n');
